      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/3da27b/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-05-07T12:57:35.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>That was me with the bug report.&nbsp; For whatever reason the app on the Kindle refused to either download or install the update correctly.&nbsp; I deleted and reinstalled, then also tried to tell the Kindle to \"update apps\".&nbsp; But no luck.&nbsp;</p><p>And of course, immediately after submitting the trouble ticket, the version updated, and all was well.&nbsp;</p><p>The big thing to check is the version number--that's the only real clue that you can spot easily as an end user.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br>Dissolv</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:18:06.883Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
