      "raw": "<p>That was me with the bug report.&nbsp; For whatever reason the app on the Kindle refused to either download or install the update correctly.&nbsp; I deleted and reinstalled, then also tried to tell the Kindle to &quot;update apps&quot;.&nbsp; But no luck.&nbsp;</p><p>And of course, immediately after submitting the trouble ticket, the version updated, and all was well.&nbsp;</p><p>The big thing to check is the version number--that&#39;s the only real clue that you can spot easily as an end user.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br />Dissolv</p>",
